            },
            "reviewBody": "Very very good \nthe second time I did it I changed it a bit and now we can't get enough\n\n3cups of pasta\n2 cups of mayo\n1/4 cup of parsley \n1/4 cup of parmesan\n2 tblspoon milk\n1 clove garlic\n2 cups of diced ham\n2 cups of celery \n4 boiled eggs cut in very small pieces \n\nI would of add green olive but my boyfriend doesn't like it \nenjoy:)",
