            },
            "reviewBody": "As written is is blah. But you can seriously add a lot to it to bang out some flavor.this is desperate need of more veggies. Blanched broccoli florets, black olives, sliced red pepper and red onion. There was no cherry tomatoes so I diced up a big fat beefsteak tomato, gave this a sprinkle of basil and it was great.",
